            "review_title": "Review at Kim's Hideaway",
            "review_text": "ChuckAtlanta\nAtlanta51 contributions\n0\nAn old favorite, new location!\nNov 2017 • Solo\nA tiny bar without 8 bar stools and two tables, this has been an ex-pat hangout for years. When I was here 4 years ago it was in a different location, but rising rents forced a move and some downsizing. No matter- Kim's favorites have followed her. Not a fancy place by any means, but friendly and cheerful. With rented rooms upstairs there are always people coming and going. Did I mention that Kim's sister cooks in back snd makes great spring rolls?\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 27, 2017",
