            "review_text": "Brian L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam268 contributions\n0\nHeart of the \"Ghetto\" off Le Thanh Ton\nAug 2016 • Friends\nKim keeps a really quaint place with great staff and a good selection of drinks. Gill looks after the music with more than 10,000 tracks available from the 60's onwards. All the tracks you can want or imagine\nHappy Hour daily from 4 to 8 and a good selection of food available if you are peckish and open till late\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 28, 2016",
